M-TARE Physical Two-Robot Integration

This repository integrates the M-TARE exploration planner with DCL-SLAM,
Livox MID360, terrain analysis, local planning, and a customized ROS1/ROS2
bridge. Repository-level integration scripts, configuration, and documentation
are provided under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see LICENSE.

